# QA M3, Stage 4 rock shelter (game-design.md "New mechanics", D-058): the
# solver route into the trough below the Steinschlag path (frame 499), then
# Resi walks up onto the path and stops under the rockfall net (row 25,
# cols 86-90), right below rock #1's column (col 88; hitbox x 1409 vs the
# rock's 1410). Rock #1 telegraphs and drops twice (at 580 and 728) and
# shatters on the net both times; rock #2 (col 92) falls beside the net.
# Normal Resi stands there for ~220 frames and is never hurt.
# If the solver route changes, re-copy the prefix and re-check the frames.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 no_event=Hurt state=playing power=normal player_x>=1400
